[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] ## Requirements
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 1. Create a file with the appropriate extension for Rust
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 2. The program should print exactly: `Hello, World!`
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 3. Add clear comments explaining the code
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 4. Ensure the code follows Rust best practices and idioms
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 5. If applicable, include build/run instructions in a comment at the top of the file
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 6. **Create a GitHub Actions workflow that automatically runs and tests the program on every push and pull request**
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] ## Expected Output
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] When the program runs, it should output:
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] ```
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] Hello, World!
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] ```
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] ## GitHub Actions Requirements
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] The CI/CD workflow should:
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Trigger on push to main branch and on pull requests
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Set up the appropriate Rust runtime/compiler
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Run the Hello World program
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Verify the output is exactly "Hello, World!"
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Show a green check mark when tests pass
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] Example workflow structure:
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Checkout code
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Setup Rust environment
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Run the program
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Assert output matches expected string
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] 
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] ## Additional Notes
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - The implementation should be simple and straightforward
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Focus on clarity and correctness
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - Use the standard library only (no external dependencies unless absolutely necessary for Rust)
[2026-09-27T15:19:34.624Z] [STDERR] - The GitHub Actions workflow should be in `.github/workflows/` directory
